Below are concrete changes you can apply straight to `app.js` (or a new `middleware.js` file) to mitigate the most common risks.

### 2.1 Add security‑hardening middleware

```js
const helmet = require('helmet');      // protects against many common HTTP attacks
const cors    = require('cors');       // configure allowed origins
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit'); // simple DOS mitigation
